{
  "name": "ClinicFlow AI — WhatsApp Conversational Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🏥 ClinicFlow AI — WhatsApp Agent\n**A 24/7 AI Front Desk for private medical clinics.**\n\n## Flow:\n1. **WhatsApp Trigger** → receives patient messages\n2. **Text filter** → drops non-text messages silently\n3. **Emergency Check** → detects keywords → immediate 911 response + log\n4. **ClinicFlow AI Agent** → handles booking, rescheduling, FAQ, intake\n5. **24h Window** → decides free-form or template reply\n6. **Logs** → every conversation saved to ConversationLogs sheet\n\n## Setup required after build:\n- WhatsApp Business Cloud credentials (Meta Developer Portal)\n- WhatsApp Phone Number ID placeholder\n- Google Calendar credential + select Doctor Calendar\n- Google Sheets credential + select ClinicFlow CRM spreadsheet\n- Update system prompt: clinic name, address, hours, insurance, parking",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5ddb3141-fae5-4f74-b9d1-6d7c09b83081",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1344,
        576
      ]
    },
